{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110339","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110339/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110339/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110339/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110339","id":3397024083,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7KenlT","number":110339,"title":"AnimationTree continuously sets property values even when no animation is playing","user":{"login":"FelixSeKett","id":20595908,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNTk1OTA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20595908?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett","html_url":"https://github.com/FelixSeKett","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FelixSeKett/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-09T07:22:58Z","updated_at":"2025-09-09T20:37:59Z","closed_at":"2025-09-09T20:37:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.6.1) - Single-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 - Apple M1 (8 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe AnimationTree appears to trigger continuous property assignments, even when no animation is playing. This results in the property being set every frame, which can potentially cause performance issues.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a Node2D with an exported float property that has a custom setter printing to the console whenever it is assigned.\n2. Add an AnimationPlayer with a simple animation that modifies this float once (no loop).\n3. Create an AnimationTree, assign it an AnimationNodeBlendTree as the root, and add a single AnimationNodeAnimation that references the animation from step 2. Connect this to the output. (The AnimationNode setup can vary. It is the same result with different AnimationNode setups, e.g. an AnimationNodeStateMachine.)\n\nRun the scene.\n\n<img width=\"1552\" height=\"987\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2b7dc4b-51ab-49fd-8e82-55ec3fbc7f7c\" />\n<img width=\"1552\" height=\"987\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f575f4e7-3e4f-48fa-8846-b87102ba111c\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[animationtree_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22228480/animationtree_test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110339/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110339/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}